                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusïmnyon pöytoghintö Yosia Topet, nyo mi mpöghoghyo werpö Inom ato memï chi kïpela atoni werïnyi anta cheptanyi kïlïkwï ropöwon nyo kitöni tororöt nyo kïkuro Molek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akunategha angoletin cho kingötyï pöytoghi Yuda asis, akïpel angoletine nko nkarinekwa cho kikïpöghisyegho ompö saghatanoni. Kikïrorchï tïkuchoni ato kïlïto Kö pö Tororöt, atolekïtö möngo Natan Melek nyo le wowïn pö lïk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Pöy 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Ot 33:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atolapay kïngany pöytoghintö Yosia ato kïpelo amörostin cho kitek pöytoghi Yuda pörko kö pö pöytoghin Aas akïngany ato kïpelo amöros cho kitek pöytoghintö Manase ompö woptin odeny ompö Kö pö Tororöt. Kirultö nyinte ato kïpelo amöros akïtörotör akïwirchï mpöghoghyo Kidron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusïmnyon Yosia wölo kïsogho körkeyïntin cho kitek pöytoghintö Solomon kongasispa Yerusalem, okumpö ewu tagh nyo pö kutïng pö Arol nyo kitekyï Solomon pöytoghinto Israel, Astoret, tororöt nyo le korka nyo pö Sidon nko Kemos tororöt pö Moap nko Molek, tororöt pö pipö Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurultö Yosia pchörino koghïn kïmïnchïrisyö, akïtörotör körkeyïn pö Asyera tororöt nyo le korka akunyïghit otini kighyongo koyo pich.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
